WEBVTT

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:47.670
Here you are, Nelly.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.380
Billy!

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:54.420
Kevin, come back here and help out.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.720
It's your and Billy's turn today, isn't it?

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:57.630
Isn't it?

00:01:58.180 --> 00:01:58.840
Honestly...

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:00.140
Honestly!

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.510
Hello!

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:05.350
Sister Azmaria!

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:06.890
Sister!

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:12.520
As always, thank you for
everything that you've done for us.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:18.030
Oh, no, it's wonderful to
see the children doing so well.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:22.030
Once we were revived,
it was as if nothing had happened.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:23.780
Sister, this way!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:30.620
Four years have passed in New York,
I'm sure it's changed quite a bit.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:31.920
That's true...

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:35.920
By the way, has Rosette...

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:39.010
We still haven't found her.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:43.470
I see...

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.850
Sing, Sister!

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:49.190
But the story isn't finished yet.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:51.600
I want to hear you too, Sister.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:54.980
It's so mysterious. When I hear you sing,

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:57.190
for some reason, it relaxes me.

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:59.820
But my power is

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.160
Yeah, you told us that before.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.780
It was called spiritual power, right?

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:10.750
But it's not that. It's just that
it makes me feel warm inside.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.250
Your song echoes
in my heart. It really does!

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.340
It really does!

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.880
Thank you, Seira, Nelly.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.130
In that case, I'll sing.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.470
Yay!

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:55.040
I'm very glad that Sister Azmaria is here.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:04:00.840
The children have been saved
by her singing voice ever so much.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:06.760
Azmaria is always saying that she wants
to become a sister, just like Rosette.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:11.350
Oh, that's right, about yesterday...

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:15.150
The children said that they
want to go and visit Joshua.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.770
In New York? If they see him,

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:21.400
they probably won't be able
to help feeling the difference in time.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:26.160
They probably want to
help him in their own way.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:30.160
We cannot go on continually
averting our eyes from reality.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:37.920
Have you been here before?

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:41.760
Just once, when I came to take
Rosette and Chrono into our custody.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:45.930
If you knew about this place,
then why didn't you tell me?

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:49.100
I'm sorry, it was
because I had sealed away

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.770
the knowledge of
Magdalene within myself.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:54.230
In that case, I'm the same.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:14.080
As I thought, they did come here.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.920
It's been a while, Magdalene.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.090
I'll be coming along in a while too.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.300
Horns!

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.850
Are they Chrono's?

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:33.890
No, those are likely Aion's.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.690
But why are they here?

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:41.190
Magdalene might
have tried to calm Aion,

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:44.400
and because Rosette
and Chrono are both kind.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:51.910
So that's how it is.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:52.910
What?

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:58.750
Aion's horns have
the power to move time,

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.210
the exact opposite of Chrono's power.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:08.380
Using Aion's horns was
the only way to undo the time freeze.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:12.720
What are you doing?

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:15.810
I thought because it's this place,
that Rosette might be here.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:23.860
No good, huh? It's ironic that
we needed our enemy's power.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:29.110
Aion might have manipulated
not only time, but eras as well.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.990
Even though it was temporary,

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:35.660
the overabundance of faith in the stigmata
that assailed the entirety of America,

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:40.210
for some people, ended up
completely confusing justice and violence.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.630
The realization of the second prophecy...

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:47.920
A war will begin in
the near future, without fail.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:50.590
I wonder why your boss won't stop it?

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:53.760
Who knows?
I've even lost my desire to ask.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.270
You really hate Him now, do you?

00:06:56.270 --> 00:07:01.020
It's not that I hate Him.
I just cut off our relationship.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.110
I have no attachments to torn wings.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:08.940
In exchange for losing them,
you'll have to bear an even heavier cross.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.700
It's the least I can do as atonement.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.460
As always,
the arrestees just keep coming.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.290
They say that the reason they did it
was for the Holy Woman's sake,

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.130
for the sake of the revolution.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.960
So far, there aren't any sideways
relations, which is a good thing for now.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:30.470
But I shudder at the thought of when
the Crusaders come together as one,

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:33.640
and the time they
declare to be the Crusade comes.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.140
Is it the Holy Woman?!

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.350
Hey now, be quiet!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:42.440
They have put me,
a Crusader, in a place like this.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:46.070
They're agents of the devils!
Bring down Heaven's punishment on them!

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:47.190
Holy Woman?!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.990
The Holy Woman has come to save us!

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.620
This incident still isn't over yet,is it?

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.620
Yeah...

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:05.830
Stop!

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:06.540
What?!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:09.840
Rosette!

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:10.920
Mary?!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:13.760
Wait! Wait, Rosette!

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.430
Rosette!

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:18.220
Can I help you?

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.890
Sorry, I thought you were someone else.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:22.980
Mary...

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:29.530
I'm sure she'll be back someday.
After all, she is Rosette.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:32.950
So cheer up and smile, okay?

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:33.780
Okay...

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.200
I'm back.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.790
Welcome back, Minister.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.880
I'm not a minister anymore, Claire.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.630
I'm sorry, it just...

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:55.090
Joshua was drawing
this picture up until earlier,

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.390
but suddenly he said
he was going to write a story.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:58.680
A story?

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.010
It looks like this is
one of the illustrations.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.100
Joshua...

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:06.350
Hey, Ewan!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.560
She said that you're writing a story?

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:10.900
Yeah, an adventure novel.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.740
You've wanted to
become a novelist, right, Joshua?

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:17.610
Yeah, but it's pretty hard.
She taught me how to use the typewriter,

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:20.740
and I'm finally able to type on it.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:24.870
In that case, is this one of
the scenes from that adventure novel?

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.250
That's right!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:29.250
This is called the Astral Line.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:32.460
It's the great river of life
that flows through space.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.710
Did you think that up?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:34.760
Of course!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:37.340
This girl is the main character.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.050
She's very strong.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:42.100
And in order to defeat the bad guys
that are after the Astral Line,

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.480
she goes on a journey to battle
them alongside her younger brother

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:47.600
who's an adventurer, and her
partner who came from outer space.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.810
It sounds interesting.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:53.780
Really, Ewan? When I finish,
will you be the first to read it?

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:54.740
Yeah...

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:02.120
Claire, thank you for today.

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:05.000
Give my regards to Sister Kate.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.580
Certainly, I'll tell her.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:13.750
Will Joshua's heart be
twelve years old forever?

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.930
In the space between God and man,

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:22.800
he destroyed his heart
in order to protect himself.

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.060
Joshua is proof of my sin.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.600
You can't really mean that.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.760
Rosette...

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:08.230
Why don't you come here?
It's so warm, it feels fine.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.440
Isn't it beautiful?

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:26.620
I like this view quite a bit.
I'd like to look at it forever.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:41.470
Hey...

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.470
Yes?

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.300
How about I undo the seal?

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:52.600
If I do, then you can heal
those wounds. You can be healthy.

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.690
It's all right.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:59.650
This is very important to me too.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.240
I don't want to lose anymore.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:19.250
Sometimes I wonder
how everyone is doing.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.300
Yeah...

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.920
But right now,

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.970
I like being together
with you, like this, better.

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:44.570
When we got to be just the two of us,

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.530
there were a lot of things
I wanted to talk to you about.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.990
But the words won't come out.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:04.090
Let's go inside.
It would be best for you to lie down.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.300
I wonder what I was?

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:14.270
I understand, but I'm scared.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.310
I'm scared!

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.480
I don't want to die!

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:32.740
I want to...
I want to live more, live more and...

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:37.620
Rosette!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.830
Chrono...

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.330
Thank you.

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:52.200
Yes?

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.240
You've found them?

00:15:57.140 --> 00:16:00.680
They've been found? It's been a long time.

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:03.600
Yes, it's already been half a year.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:07.690
It appears that they looked quite happy.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:14.660
Remington,
there's something I want to ask you.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.450
What is it?

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.080
Will the soul of someone
who has contracted with a devil

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:21.450
wander about Hell?

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.250
No, that's just superstition.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:30.210
Thank you for saying that.

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:33.930
That girl... Rosette was truly a believer.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:37.550
Even though she contracted with a devil,

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:40.310
she followed the teachings
of mercy, and made friends with it.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:45.440
I believe that her soul is
more virtuous than anyone else's.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.980
Remington,
do you have any desire to come back?

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.370
I'm sorry, but...

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:00.580
I see...

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:03.000
Remington...

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.000
I will not abandon my faith.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:12.510
I thought that you would say that.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:15.760
Thank you for telling me, Sister Kate.

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.010
You're working hard, Joshua.

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:22.470
Of course!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:26.190
I need to finish it up quickly
so you can look at it, Ewan.

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:28.020
You don't have to be in such a rush.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:30.320
I can wait until you're finished.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:33.780
It'll be ready soon, so look forward to it!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:34.820
Sure...

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:57.860
Come in.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.320
What is the matter?

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:03.280
There's a report from the Miami branch

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:06.040
that another person
with stigmata has appeared.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.450
Stigmata?!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:48.700
Rosette, Chrono, I will become stronger.

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:52.790
So please watch over me, okay?
